* Open Music Labs BA662 clone topology, expanded from dual matched pairs.
* The transistor wrapper definitions and analysis deck are injected by
* tests/python/reference_ba662_spice.py. Manufacturer model text is downloaded
* into ignored build output and is deliberately not copied into this project.

__DEVICE_MODELS__

.subckt BA662 p1 p2 p3 p4 vm p6 p7 p8 vp
* Control-current mirror and differential input pair.
XQ1A n2 p1 vm NPN_DEVICE
XQ1B p1 p1 vm NPN_DEVICE
XQ2A n7 p2 n2 NPN_DEVICE
XQ2B n5 p3 n2 NPN_DEVICE

* PNP Wilson current-mirror loads.
XQ3A n7 n10 vp PNP_DEVICE
XQ3B n10 n10 vp PNP_DEVICE
XQ4A n5 n11 vp PNP_DEVICE
XQ4B n11 n11 vp PNP_DEVICE
XQ5A n12 n7 n10 PNP_DEVICE
XQ5B p6 n5 n11 PNP_DEVICE

* NPN output mirror and the emitter-follower buffer.
XQ6A n12 n14 vm NPN_DEVICE
XQ6B n14 n14 vm NPN_DEVICE
XQ7A vp p7 p8 NPN_DEVICE
XQ7B p6 n12 n14 NPN_DEVICE

* Unused half of the PNP matched pair retained to match the published clone.
XQ8A vm n20 n18 PNP_DEVICE
XQ8B n17 p8 n19 PNP_DEVICE

* Buffer current sink. The 47k resistor is external to the original IC die,
* but is part of the published clone and is driven from BA662 pin 4.
XQ9A p8 n21 vm NPN_DEVICE
XQ9B n21 n21 vm NPN_DEVICE
RBIAS p4 n21 47k
RUNUSED vp n18 10k
.ends BA662

__ANALYSIS_DECK__
